etained gitlink evidence; no old module zip, package binary or installed deployment identity is claimed. The imported SM route is already unguarded. The later 5a6b68ee OAuth rollout adds an enforcement framework and applies it to siblings while leaving SM unchanged. Lack of a changed SM line does not by itself refute a later security-policy exposure: the missing policy is meaningful when OAuth is enabled. The rollout is a supported policy-transition contribution, but neither lane supplies the original atomic SM-registration member or a complete before/after security-policy history that makes its preferred object the sole origin. The exact retained file has an OpenAPI Generator header. Conventional code generation is not an LLM/AI coding disclosure. The named project organization is admissible as an organization but does not establish atomic member authorship or marker coverage; lack of a personal name is not itself the required gap.", "evidence": [{"path": "/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/r14-closeout-20260915/r1-core-chain10-20260925-a2/execution/cases/alias-3c3bca6672648b7a93a7d9e8.json", "sha256": "2a28e5af0b8ec184ae279b12954135d0959b949de577c744d3cce732ae0d70f5"}, {"path": "/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/r14-closeout-20260915/r1-core-chain10-20260925-a2/execution/cases/alias-3c3bca6672648b7a93a7d9e8.md", "sha256": "696217391097513174f399d9dff7b52a259be6e710f9b9c22a8f5f0452aacf5e"}, {"path": "/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/round14-top500-20260905/primary/w220.json", "sha256": "e58977dc34e65a09fe5527e04a262d9e008b1383c81f2505883d7b9a64b93abb"}, {"path": "/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/round14-top500-20260905/blind-r14/w220.json", "sha256": "7c349c6fda7ac61822a4e7c3986791e0d85d89198d9202350ef4d4aaea93c86f"}, {"path": "/home/hanqing/agents/ai-slop/research/r14-closeout-20260915/r1-core-chain10-20260925-a2/execution/evidence/w220-guard-source.json", "sha256": "9d54b9eea23fe6cede8e39b3f6560a304790f434a55253a4c471f187bcfd81c6"}, {"path": "/ho