  "bic_granularity": "ATOMIC",
  "bug_semantics": "praisonai serve agents documents --api-key as authentication for the FastAPI agents server, parses it into config, and forwards it into ServeHandler._create_agents_app, but that function never installs middleware or a FastAPI dependency. POST {path} (default /agents) therefore executes AgentsGenerator.generate_crew_and_kickoff() for any network caller. From 6a99b73 onward, POST /agents/{agent_name} additionally invokes a registered agent.start/astart with the same missing check, while /api/v1/agents/{id}/invoke on the mounted agent_invoke router remains separately gated by CALL_SERVER_TOKEN. Binding --host 0.0.0.0 with --api-key therefore leaves the compatibility invocation routes unauthenticated (CWE-306).",
