d choice, are pinned in the case report and history.", "ai": "Current resolution: AI_CODE_FLAWED: human bf483f3bd6036aca72fb129bd3cd3b19ff8f1c7c first created the agents application without using the advertised api_key. The later original PR member 9b841270b67d6b5e7572a40f46b8df6ac57abb72, authored and committed by praisonai-triage-agent[bot], adds POST /agents/{agent_name}, calls start/astart and omits authentication on that route too. Its independently authenticated /api/v1 router does not protect the compatibility route. This is new flawed invocation code, not attribution borrowed from the successful Cursor-assisted fix. 2f9677abb2ea68eab864ee8b6a828fd0141612e1 installs shared Bearer/X-API-Key middleware when api_key is configured; it closes both compatibility paths in v4.6.58. Binding a configured-key server to a reachable interface is the relevant prerequisite; ordinary authorized invocation remains permitted. Original primary and blind-r14 hypotheses, including the superseded choice, are pinned in the case report and history.", "fix": "Current resolution: fix_sha=2f9677abb2ea68eab864ee8b6a828fd0141612e1; direct_fix_sha=2f9677abb2ea68eab864ee8b6a828fd0141612e1; atomic_repair_sha=None; AI_CODE_FLAWED: human bf483f3bd6036aca72fb129bd3cd3b19ff8f1c7c first created the agents application without using the advertised api_key. The later original PR member 9b841270b67d6b5e7572a40f46b8df6ac57abb72, authored and committed by praisonai-triage-agent[bot], adds POST /agents/{agent_name}, calls start/astart and omits authentication on that route too. Its independently authenticated /api/v1 router does not protect the compatibility route. This is new flawed invocation code, not attribution borrowed from the successful Cursor-assisted fix. 2f9677abb2ea68eab864ee8b6a828fd0141612e1 installs shared Bearer/X-API-Key middleware when api_key is configured; it closes both compatibility paths in v4.6.58. Binding a configured-key server to a reachable interface is the relevant prerequi